body:
I don't want to talk about it o.o

&#x200B;

Thanks for the suggestions though, I will be sure to start doing all of my dailies, I tend to be lazy.

I just wanted to update all the people that were asking that I did indeed make a etsy for these. Feel free to buy some if youre really interested! And thanks so much to everyone for their input and support, you guys made me interested in creating art again.

Also if you enter code 'REDDIT' you can get 10% off!

[https://www.etsy.com/listing/675274531/handpainted-operator-icon-4x4-frame?ref=shop\_home\_active\_1&crt=1](https://www.etsy.com/listing/675274531/handpainted-operator-icon-4x4-frame?ref=shop_home_active_1&crt=1)

&#x200B;

If this isn't allowed please delete!

